OL,3,GNEWSAFrom cigarettes to energy drinks -
OL,4,Ahalf a century behind a newsagents
OL,5,Acounter
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf you stood behind the same counter in
OL,8,Fthe same shop every day for almost half
OL,9,Fa century, what changes do you think
OL,10,Fyou would see?
OL,12,FEugene Diamond has done just that,
OL,13,Fwatching as customers coming in for
OL,14,Fcigarettes and newspapers evolved into
OL,15,Fpeople asking for vapes and energy
OL,16,Fdrinks.
OL,18,FOn Sunday he will pull the shutters
OL,19,Fdown on Diamonds newsagents for the
OL,20,Ffinal time after 49 years.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
