OL,3,GNEWSAFrom cigarettes to energy drinks -
OL,4,Ahalf a century behind a newsagents
OL,5,Acounter
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite all the changes, the thing he
OL,8,Fsaid the thing he will miss the most is
OL,9,Fsomething that has never changed - the
OL,10,Fcraic with his customers.
